flowchart TD
  Browser[Officer browser] --> TLS[HTTPS reverse proxy on chosen host]
  TLS --> Next[Next.js production server]
  Next --> DB[(Persistent MariaDB database)]
  Next --> Storage[(Persistent private disk or private S3)]
  Next --> OCR[Private FastAPI service / token for remote access]
  OCR --> CPU[CPU PaddleOCR models]
  DB --> Backup[Database backup plus scan storage backup]
  Storage --> Backup
  Backup --> Restore[Separate restore database and directory]
  Monitor[Health monitoring] --> Next
  Monitor --> OCR
  Note[Local pilot: Next 3000 / OCR 8000 / MariaDB 3306]
